y lifting to me. Would you be so kind as to attend to the letters?",0,""],["w",0.3],["se","se_109"],["ctl","avg1_125","a",null,null,0.55,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",2.0],["se","se_050"],["cbg",0,0.0,null,1.1,"OutQuad",0.5,null,null,null],["w",1.3],["mrt",1,"z","002","shock",null],["say","avg3_100","That mountain of mail is almost gone already...",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Is this daily grind the secret to her strength? No, this workload is just insane... Freesia, you have my respect.",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.7],["w",0.7],["bgm",""],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","sky_sunny",0,0.0],["cbg",0,100.0,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,0.0,null,1.13,"Linear",20.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.5],["w",2.0],["cbg",0,null,100.0,null,"OutQuad",1.3,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_125","a","002",0.49,null,null,0,null,0.0],["bg","posthouse_inside",0,1.0],["w",1.5],["bgm","m49"],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"OutQuad",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_125","a",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_125","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_125","Next, we sort. We verify addresses, categorize by region, then bundle neighboring locations together.",0,""],["show","avg1_112","a","002",0.28,null,null,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,"shock",0.3,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["ctl","avg1_125","a",null,null,0.7,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.8],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_112","a","007","shock",null,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Talk about attention to detail. And then you have to hand-deliver every single one? That's incredible!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",0.7],["ctl","avg1_125","a",nul